WEBVTT

s1-1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.700
Energy never sleeps.
Protecting it begins with a clear view.

s2-1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.800
From generation and higher voltage,

s2-2
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.500
through transmission,
lower voltage and distribution,

s2-3
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:23.700
every stage needs careful oversight to protect the site
and keep essential services running.

s3-1
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.200
Gates, cameras and patrols
connect with the control room.

s3-2
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:32.100
Where authorized data and integrations
are available,

s3-3
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.700
this shared view helps security teams
understand events and make informed decisions.

s4-1
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.100
In this concept, the digital twin links assets
with available information

s4-2
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.700
and presents alerts for review.

s4-3
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.700
It supports the team;
people authorize the actions.

s5-1
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.100
Sadeed. Smarter decisions. Faster execution.

s5-2
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.900
Illustrative scenes, not a live feed.
